content:
The evidence is clear enough. Messages are stuck as `pending` (not lost/consumed), oldest at t=567 which is after the deploy at t=464 and correlates with worker restart storms starting t=499/500. The worker is restarting so fast it never picks up pending messages. No competing hypothesis needs investigation.

```json
